/* wubu_pixmap_test.c -- the slerm gate for SLERM-2002 stage 1.
 *
 * Every image here was produced by a generator that is NOT our decoder: Python's
 * zlib plus a hand-written application of each PNG filter type. A pass therefore
 * means the filters were inverted correctly, not merely consistently. Every case
 * compares real pixel bytes, not just dimensions.
 *
 * Refusals are the other half: damaged CRC, truncation, an unsupported bit depth,
 * an undersized scratch buffer, an undersized pixel buffer and non-image input.
 */
